title: Guest 3. Load and cache analyses
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Browser as Next.js Client<br/>(Browser)
    participant Dexie as Local Persistence<br/>(Dexie / IndexedDB)

    box rgb(219, 234, 254) FastAPI
        participant API as API Layer<br/>(Routes / Validation)
        participant Engine as Engine Layer<br/>(Risk / Optimization)
    end

    participant YF as yfinance

    Note over Browser,Dexie: Trigger: Active portfolio holdings are loaded
    Browser->>Browser: Detect active portfolio holdings
    Note over Browser,Dexie: Holdings trigger quote loading and<br/>analysis-cache lookup separately

    Browser->>Dexie: Read by analysis type and<br/>stable request serialization
    Dexie-->>Browser: Cached results or cache misses
    Browser-->>User: Render cached results<br/>or analysis placeholders

    opt First-run sample is created, or the user runs analyses
        alt First-run Sample Portfolio
            Browser->>Browser: Trigger all analyses automatically
        else User-triggered analysis
            User->>Browser: Click Run All Analyses
        end
        Browser->>API: POST /api/v1/analyze,<br/>/api/v1/stress-test, and /api/v1/optimize in parallel
        API->>Engine: Validate requests and run<br/>the three analyses
        Engine->>YF: Retrieve required current<br/>and historical prices
        YF-->>Engine: Market data
        Engine-->>API: VaR, stress-test, and<br/>optimizer results
        API-->>Browser: JSON responses
        Browser->>Dexie: Cache each analysis response
        Dexie-->>Browser: Cache writes acknowledged
        Browser-->>User: Render analysis results
    end

    Note over Browser,Dexie: Analysis responses remain in this browser
